{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:51 2026-09-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:51 2026-09-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:51 2026-09-30 HKT</p><p>今日（30日）早上9時21分，警方接獲柯士甸道西1號對開一地盤的工友報案，指地盤內有財物失竊，擺放在一個櫃內的多張Pokémon（寶可夢）卡被人偷去。警員接報到場調查，經點算後相信失竊的卡牌價值共約數千元，列作地盤盜竊案，正追緝涉案賊人。</p><img alt=\"警方接報到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3173625929be17acce3050ba59487bbb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c6ea4aa661d9e6bc21af60189e57eb0f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員進入盤調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9e3c7fede3d0de2ecfe2110dd24d39fb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/41ff1a4b49fb72a46b893eb69ae40d10/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9a80f44db186ed49f05a20f7ce8f4eb0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是柯士甸道西1號對開地盤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f93869a52739f5d2202e680c6823921d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-30_at_10_32_14.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T02:59:37.415783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}